    featuredImagePrompt: "A surreal, conceptual visual representing digital chaos and information overload. Abstract elements like interconnected nodes, glowing data streams, and fragmented email icons swirling around a central, ethereal, glowing AI brain or core. The color palette should be vibrant blues, purples, and electric greens against a dark, dynamic background, conveying a sense of rapid, uncontrollable digital communication. Emphasize the 'reply-all' aspect with subtle, repeating email envelope motifs that are visually overwhelming but not literal spam. Avoid any specific human figures or literal computer screens. Focus on abstract digital entanglement. High resolution, futuristic aesthetic.",
