    featuredImagePrompt: "A highly detailed, realistic photograph set in a modern, sterile medical isolation unit in Nigeria. The foreground shows a Nigerian healthcare worker, wearing advanced personal protective equipment (PPE) including a hazmat suit and face shield, carefully observing a patient (partially obscured, covered by blanket) through a glass barrier. The background subtly depicts other medical equipment and monitors, all conveying a sense of urgent, controlled medical response and professionalism. The lighting is clinical and bright, emphasizing clarity and safety. Focus on the healthcare worker's dedication and the advanced containment measures in place.",
