    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual, dynamic visual representing global cricket expansion and US investment. Imagine a cricket ball seamlessly morphing into a stylized globe, with subtle overlays of digital currency symbols (like dollar and rupee signs) and interconnected lines indicating global routes. In the background, a blend of a traditional cricket stadium in India and a modern cityscape skyline (like New York or Los Angeles) are subtly integrated, symbolizing the fusion of traditional and new markets. The overall aesthetic should be vibrant, futuristic, and convey growth and financial flow.",
