    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a central, dynamic graphic depicting a downward arrow piercing through a digital Bitcoin icon, with stylized oil derricks and a subtle, blurred map of the Middle East in the background. The color palette should be muted, reflecting market tension, with hints of red and orange for oil, and digital blue for crypto. The composition should convey urgency and the interconnectedness of global events, suitable for a news headline, avoiding generic stock imagery.",
    imageAltText: "Bitcoin price struggling below $82,000 due to rising oil prices and Middle East tensions, depicted as a digital chart falling amidst geopolitical symbols.",
