    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic, data-driven visual representing global stock market trends and corporate earnings. The central focus is a highly detailed, abstract digital interface featuring glowing stock charts and bar graphs, illustrating upward trends for corporate profits. Numbers and financial data points are subtly embedded within the graphs. In the background, a faint, interconnected world map suggests global financial impact, with specific regions like North America, Europe, and Asia faintly highlighted. Elements of financial documents or reports are subtly incorporated as texture. The color scheme is professional and optimistic, using deep blues, greens, and subtle metallic gold for data accents. The composition is a close-up, emphasizing the intricate data analysis, without any human presence, purely focusing on digital financial data representation.",
