    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a split composition. On one side, a dramatic, slightly desaturated image of parched, cracked earth under an oppressive orange sky, symbolizing record heat and environmental degradation. On the other side, a vibrant, clear underwater scene with a human hand gently touching a recovering, colorful coral reef, and in the background, lush, dense green forest canopy under a bright, clean sky. Overlay text elements integrated into the layout read 'Global Climate Crisis' and 'New Paths to Recovery.' The overall aesthetic should be professional and impactful, suitable for a news publication, avoiding any generic stock photo feel.",
