    featuredImagePrompt: "A sophisticated and clean editorial news layout. The central focus is a dynamic, upward-trending stylized stock market graph, subtly integrated with a background showing Earth from orbit, dotted with the faint glow of Starlink satellites. A translucent, futuristic rocket silhouette (representing Starship) is subtly placed in the mid-ground, indicating future aspirations and progress. The color palette is modern, featuring deep blues, greens, and metallic silver, conveying both technological advancement and financial growth. The overall composition is balanced, professional, and visually compelling, designed to stand out in a news feed.",
