    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a sleek, futuristic Microsoft Surface Laptop Ultra with subtle glowing AI elements emanating from its screen, juxtaposed with abstract, translucent digital privacy shields or blurred human figures in the background, symbolizing data protection. The overall composition should be clean, professional, and visually convey the tension between cutting-edge technology and user privacy concerns. Utilize a cool color palette with blues and greens, and a dynamic, slightly angled perspective.",
