      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A \'Neutral to Bearish\' outlook is most probable in the short term. While a complete meltdown is unlikely, the challenges of a minority government navigating social unrest and fiscal demands suggest continued market sensitivity and slower recovery. Probability: Bearish (40%), Neutral (45%), Bullish (15%).",
      potentialCatalysts: ["Swift and peaceful resolution of social unrest.", "Successful passage of the 2027 budget with cross-party support.", "Concrete and credible long-term deficit reduction strategy announced.", "Strong economic data from France or the Eurozone.", "Supportive statements or actions from the European Central Bank (ECB)."],
