      bearCase: "Despite current successes, UNH remains exposed to significant regulatory risks in the U.S. healthcare sector. Unforeseen increases in medical utilization or aggressive policy changes could rapidly erode profitability. Broader economic slowdowns or intensified competition could also pressure enrollment and margins, leading to a deceleration in growth.",
