    outlook: "In the short term, the equity market may remain tethered to bond yield movements. A pause or modest slowdown in Fed rate hikes could provide a tailwind for stocks, especially technology names. However, if inflation expectations persist or rise, equity valuations could face renewed pressure. The AI sector will continue to be a focal point, with earnings guidance and regulatory developments shaping investor sentiment.",
