      keyRisks: ["Immediate regulatory intervention or legal challenges from government bodies.", "Significant negative public perception or ethical condemnations leading to user exodus.", "Evidence of market manipulation or the spread of false narratives through the platform.", "Lack of clear, verifiable resolution for \'disputed facts,\' leading to user frustration."],
