      keyRisks: ["Direct sanctions against Tether or key executives.", "Widespread delisting of USDT from major exchanges.", "Failure to demonstrate adequate AML/CFT controls to global regulators.", "A \'bank run\' scenario on USDT leading to a de-pegging event."],
